            <ArticleTitle>Grand mal seizure after extradural morphine analgesia.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>733-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Following an elective Caesarean section under extradural anaesthesia, a 30-yr-old known epileptic woman (gravida 4, para 3) developed a tonic-clonic seizure, 6 h after the administration of morphine 3 mg into the extradural space. Possible aetiological factors are discussed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
